To stipple at a left (number) by a top (number) for a breadth (number) over a height (number) with a shade (number):
  Let the scanline be 0.
  Repeat the height times:
    Let the fleck be the remainder of the scanline divided by 2.
    While the fleck is less than the breadth:
      Paint Screen at (the left + the fleck) by (the top + the scanline) with the shade.
      Add 2 to the fleck.
    Add 1 to the scanline.

